  "releaseNotes": "### 14.3.8\n* Fixes an issue parsing DOC(X) files with malformed URI. (J#MAMBO-1932)\n* Improved demo mode with generated Office documents. (J#PDFOF-189)\n* Improves PDF to Office conversion. (J#PDFOF-185)\n* Fixes an issue parsing XLS(X) documents with malformed URI (J#MAMBO-1937)\n* Improves QR Code reading accuracy. (J#GDBC-492)",
